reports/phase2/suretriggers-phase2.claude.raw.json:532:      "assessment": "Secure. The permission callback correctly uses hash_equals() for timing-safe token comparison. Returns false when the stored secret key is empty, preventing access when plugin is not connected. Token is stored encrypted via Encryption::encrypt().",
reports/phase2/suretriggers-phase2.claude.raw.json:538:      "assessment": "Secure. All sensitive routes use autheticate_user as permission callback. The two __return_true routes (api-test, create-wp-connection) are appropriately designed: api-test is a static health check, create-wp-connection has layered internal authentication.",
reports/phase2/suretriggers-phase2.claude.raw.json:544:      "assessment": "Secure. reset_plugin() at Loader.php:838-850 requires nonce verification (st-reset-action) AND manage_options capability check. The nonce is generated in admin context only.",
reports/phase2/suretriggers-phase2.claude.raw.json:550:      "assessment": "Secure. Requires nonce verification (sure-trigger-connect) AND administrator capability check. Processes input with sanitize_text_field and sanitize_email.",
reports/phase2/suretriggers-phase2.claude.raw.json:556:      "assessment": "Secure. suretrigger_trigger_button_action() verifies nonce (suretrigger_form). Uses sanitize_text_field for all POST inputs. Redirect URLs are passed through esc_url_raw().",
reports/phase2/suretriggers-phase2.claude.raw.json:562:      "assessment": "Secure. All database queries in WebhookRequestsController use $wpdb->prepare() with parameterized statements. No raw SQL construction from user input observed.",
reports/phase2/suretriggers-phase2.claude.raw.json:568:      "assessment": "Adequately secure. SaasApiToken stores the key encrypted via Encryption::encrypt() in wp_options under 'suretrigger_options'. Keys longer than 80 chars are not re-encrypted (line 46-47). Decryption is handled transparently.",
